<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Support Me</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #1f2b4a;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, #ffe87a 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%, #ff9dd5 0 7%, transparent 8%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 84%, #86ffd5 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 86% 88%, #8ad4ff 0 9%, transparent 10%),
                linear-gradient(160deg, #fff4d6 0%, #ffe0f0 35%, #ddf8ff 72%, #e4ffef 100%);
        }
        .header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .content-section {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffffd9;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #e5e9ff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(58, 79, 132, 0.12);
        }
        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .column {
            padding: 10px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #2d2d7a;
            border-bottom: 3px dashed #a5b3ff;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h3 {
            color: #5f26ce;
        }
        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ff7db8, #ff5f95);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .back-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .coffee-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ffe97e, #ffd447);
            color: #2d2d7a;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(53, 57, 120, 0.15);
            transition: transform 0.1s;
        }
        .coffee-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .grid-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1>Buy me a coffee ☕️🎻</h1>
        <p>Making this app is not easy. Your support is appreciated. It does not have to be financially. Your feedback is also crucial.</p>
        <p><strong>Email and Paypal email:</strong> chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Payment in Hong Kong</h2>
        <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="column">
                <h3>PayMe</h3>
                <p><a href="https://payme.hsbc/maxxxx1" target="_blank">https://payme.hsbc/maxxxx1</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="column">
                <img src="/images/hkqr_code.jpeg" alt="Alipay QR Code">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Worldwide Support</h2>
        <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="column">
                <h3>Buy Me A Coffee</h3>
                <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/maxchanhi" target="_blank" class="coffee-btn">
                    ☕ Buy me a coffee
                </a>
                <p>⬆️ Click me!</p>
                <p><strong>Paypal email:</strong> chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk</p>
            </div>
            <div class="column">
                <img src="/images/paypal_code.jpeg" alt="Paypal QR Code">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/ai_chat') %>
</body>
</html>
